---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

// A /now page (nownownow.com convention): what I'm focused on right now.
// Keep it current and honest. Update the date when it changes. No internal
// hostnames/IPs or client detail.
const updated = 'August 2026';

const focus = [
  {
    heading: 'Running the lab',
    body: 'Keeping the 9-node Talos Kubernetes cluster healthy under GitOps, and slowly retiring the last of the homegrown glue in favor of boring, standard tooling. Recent work: controlled image updates through Renovate so every version bump is a reviewable, revertible change.',
  },
  {
    heading: 'Writing it down',
    body: "Turning the interesting failures and design calls into posts here. The queue includes a hardware deep-dive follow-up and a couple of outage post-mortems I've been meaning to write properly.",
  },
  {
    heading: 'Open source',
    body: 'Maintaining dnsweaver: keeping DNS records following the infrastructure instead of drifting. Small, focused, well-tested Go. It has an outside contributor now. Someone went looking for a way to keep Technitium records in step with Traefik, found mine instead of writing their own, hit a bug my lab could never have produced, and sent the fix before we ever spoke.',
  },
  {
    heading: 'Upstream',
    body: 'Two contributions merged into OPNsense, six years apart. A maximum packet length option for traffic shaper rules back in 2020, and BGP maximum-paths for ECMP this March, which shipped in FRR plugin 1.52 with its documentation alongside it. The second one started life as an issue a bot closed after six months of nobody picking it up.',
  },
  {
    heading: 'Sharpening the craft',
    body: 'Getting better at directing AI agents without letting the quality bar slip. The judgment stays mine; the typing is just faster.',
  },
];
---

<Layout title="Now · ProbablyFine" description="What Maxfield is focused on right now.">
  <section class="max-w-[var(--container-shell)] mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-8">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-accent)]">$ cat ./now</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-3">Now</h1>
    <p class="text-[var(--color-ink-dim)] mt-3 leading-relaxed">
      What I'm focused on at the moment. This is a{' '}
      <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" rel="noopener" data-umami-event="outbound-nowpage" class="hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]">now page</a>,
      so it goes stale on purpose between updates.
    </p>
    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-[var(--color-ink-dim)] mt-4">last updated {updated}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-[var(--container-shell)] mx-auto px-6 pb-8">
    {
      focus.map((f) => (
        <div class="py-5 border-t border-[var(--color-line)]">
          <h2 class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-accent)]"># {f.heading}</h2>
          <p class="text-[var(--color-ink-dim)] mt-2 leading-relaxed">{f.body}</p>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-[var(--container-shell)] mx-auto px-6 pb-16">
    <p class="text-[var(--color-ink-dim)] text-sm">
      More about the professional side over on{' '}
      <a href="https://maxfieldallison.com?utm_source=probablyfine&utm_medium=site" rel="noopener" data-umami-event="outbound-maxfieldallison" class="hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]">maxfieldallison.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
